      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "Enough of dinosaurs now, both skeletons and rubber reproducitons. Here is a last look at the life like rubber Torosaurus model as we move out of the dinosaur special exhibit. (Ottawa, Canada, June 2015)",
