      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "A far shot of the real rubberized squid. Notes in previous captions. A bright spotlight on the animal resulted in a rather overexposed shot. Sorry about that. (Ottawa, Canada, June 2015)",
      "dateCreated": "2015-06-01 00:00",
