      "title": "File:Another view of the rubberized real ostrich (20743178922).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Another_view_of_the_rubberized_real_ostrich_%2820743178922%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Another_view_of_the_rubberized_real_ostrich_(20743178922).jpg",
      "width": 2848,
      "height": 4288,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "Full front view of the real but siliconized/ rubberized ostrich showing off it's muscles and feathers. This was once a live bird roaming the plains of Africa! Notes about rubberizing animal bodies appear in previous captions. Bright spot lighting has rendered the picture somewhat over exposed- sorry about that.  (Ottawa, Canada, June 2015)",
