      "width": 2848,
      "height": 4288,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "shankar s. from Dubai, united arab emirates",
      "description": "A once real and live horse, and those are real hose muscles you see there. Thank goodness this horse is muscles only- they did not preserve any of the internal organs, unlike a camel you will see after a few more photos. This is in the Canada Museum of Nature, Ottawa, Canada.  Notes about rubberizing animal bodies appear in previous captions.  (Ottawa, Canada, June 2015)",
